\"Oh Hana and Choi Won are incredibly close platonic friends: throughout 20 years, they've braved it all through thick and thin. As Hana's 30th birthday approaches, Won extols the virtues of aging as a man—like a wine—while explaining that women are like grapes that shrivel into raisins. Determined to prove him wrong, Hana strikes a bet on which of the two will marry before turning 35. Can these two friends make the ultimate leap?\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lRrpSShn0pAVHmnxKseLu9aVtMz.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2015-06-27\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"A model disappears before a shoe launch. In the chaos, her boyfriend brings more to her plate with marriage.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wQxj2g1aKUb6DH9n9SDe80g49AJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-27\",\"runtime\":64},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"Oh Hana fears the gossip around Joo Hojoon's wedding. Thing get worse at work, and her heart flutters for an intern.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9r3rknE8rtvee2ENuqsRlrjGaiH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-06-28\",\"runtime\":64},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Hana begins to feel attracted to Gi Seongjae. He keeps on approaching her, where Choi Won feels uneasy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xdhFF5bGTKqSpmA7Lk5zVT0xnFe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-04\",\"runtime\":64},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Hana's family suspects a relationship between her and Won. They suddenly announce their hot spring trip.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kKDXdkkSgnnfx16DPTnC8gq9bOu.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-05\",\"runtime\":64},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Cha Seohoo returns and Won is left nervous. Hana's heart may have gotten her heart shaking for him again.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A1AI0WS2RzXMNfEVmO8Wf2Pp9M4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-11\",\"runtime\":64},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Seohoo learns about the chance of Lee Soeun being Won's junior at work. He now makes a request to meet Hana.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iJI7tgHDHa2EsGtef8WkQs4CIgq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-12\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Hana gets some time alone to figure out herself. Seohoo feels something sweeter for Hana.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yNNNPerVmTtFrceeUo6m1wscC18.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-18\",\"runtime\":64},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"Won has the opportunity for a two-year trip for training. Hana hears Park Jonghoon talking about the engagement.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5pfzTvKesh2rnJ7HiKwSvnbSyRR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-19\",\"runtime\":61},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Seohoo begins to boldly express his feelings for Hana. Director Byeon Wooshik orders a review of the project.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Au42Kkj4ViqRMUhy9XGt51rMxAg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-25\",\"runtime\":62},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Changsoo and Jeongmi's wedding after-party happens. Hana and Won get awkward, and friends suspect them.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tHnBNsLCYfkqlyOqvJGjzLxS2qj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-07-26\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"Seohoo goes inside the house of Hana's house and kneels just to get permission from the family.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kbdost6tokrrUwbtrhxwTfDElHb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-08-01\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":12,\"nam